# A bad keyword in each place of a note file: the board's file holds one note whose sender, stamp, expire, to or
# subject keyword is misspelled (tools/fixtures/files/badkey-*), one board each, so boot logs "Load_notes: bad key
# word." five times and the boards are empty. (A misspelled text keyword, badkey-text, goes on General in
# notes-badtext.)
@place badkey-sender ../notes/General
@place badkey-stamp ../notes/Ideas
@place badkey-expire ../notes/Announce
@place badkey-to ../notes/Bugs
@place badkey-subject ../notes/Personal
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
board
